e Diseases Surveillance System (NNDSS)\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were compared with annual data from 2012 through 2021\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were compared with annual data from 2012 through 2021\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Missed opportunities for prevention were stratified by U.S. Census Bureau region and by race and ethnicity of the birth parent.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Prenatal testing and treatment status were stratified according to whether at least one prenatal care visit had occurred during the pregnancy.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were completed using Stata statistical software (version 15.1; StataCorp).\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}